<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak July jobless rises to 12.5 pct (12.1)-SUSR.</title>
<headline>Slovak July jobless rises to 12.5 pct (12.1)-SUSR.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of jobless in Slovakia in July was 321,661 workers, or 12.5 percent of the workforce, up from 12.12 percent in June, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Thursday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK UNEMPLOYMENT RATE  July '96    June '96    July '95</p>
<p>  Jobless total	     321,661     311,244     343,147</p>
<p>  percentage of workforce   12.5	  12.1	  13.5</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-210-3687</p>
</text>
